  "updated_at": "2026-03-09",
  "bio": "Cliff Collard is a master tattoo artist with over two decades of experience, specializing in newschool, illustrative, and Japanese styles. Operating out of Historic Downtown Bryan, TX, Cliff owns the esteemed Arsenal Tattoo studio, where his dedication to professionalism is reflected in both the quality of his artwork and the meticulous cleanliness of his establishment. Clients seeking a superbly executed tattoo in a pristine environment will find Cliff to be the ideal artist for their needs.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Bryan, Texas, United States"
